#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/bluetooth/index.rst:2
msgid "Bluetooth"
msgstr "蓝牙"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/bluetooth/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"Networking connected the camera to anything reachable through an access "
"point and a router. Bluetooth is the opposite trade. The camera gives up "
"*reach* and gets *short range, low power, and no infrastructure* in return "
"-- a couple of metres of direct radio link to a phone or a sensor in the "
"same room, no Wi-Fi network to join, no router to route through, power draw "
"small enough that a coin cell can keep the camera alive for months."
msgstr ""
"网络把摄像头连接到任何可以通过接入点和路由器到达的目标。蓝牙则是相反的取舍。摄像头放弃了\\ *覆盖范围*\\ ，换来的是\\ "
"*短距离、低功耗以及无需基础设施*\\ ——与同一房间内的手机或传感器之间几米的直接无线链路，无需加入 Wi-Fi "
"网络，无需经路由器转发，功耗低到一颗纽扣电池就能让摄像头存活数月。"

#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/bluetooth/index.rst:14
msgid ""
"The Python side of this is the :mod:`aioble` module -- an "
":mod:`asyncio`-friendly wrapper that turns the BLE radio's roles, "
"advertising, discovery, and read/write/ notify primitives into coroutines."
msgstr ""
"其 Python 一侧是 :mod:`aioble` 模块——一个对 :mod:`asyncio` 友好的封装，它把 BLE "
"无线电的角色、广播、发现以及读/写/通知原语转化为协程。"
